      "description": [
        {
          "text": "<p>This entry refers to Shieldin complex subunit 2 (also known as Protein FAM35A or RINN2). Shieldin complex is composed of REV7, RINN1 (CTC-534A2.2), RINN2 (FAM35A), and RINN3 (C20ORF196), and plays an important role in repair of DNA double-stranded breaks [[cite:PUB00089626]].</p>",
